  "translation": "This morning I set off from home to go to the library. I walked with my friend. There were many books inside the library. I borrowed a Chinese book, and he borrowed an English book. I don't like English books. We sat by the window to read. While reading, I was very happy. My friend also felt very happy. At noon we ate next to the library. I ate a bread roll, and he ate a bowl of noodles. Then we went back to school for class. In the afternoon we still had class. After going home in the evening, I first did my homework, then watched TV. Today was truly a fulfilling day."
